From a34a2e5d8273ccf3d3f5582194bee2cab53b88a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Miller <scott@360machineshop.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:46:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): keep Mazak probe labels unique in numbered
 programs

Share used N numbers between ordinary block numbering and probe labels.
Reserve each alarm target before emitting its branch, and write the label
without an automatic prefix. Refuse numbering that cannot advance safely.

Add regression tests and an every-block probing golden in script_probe.
Record the allocation decision and the independent Mazak post changes.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #4342
